# 🎯 C++ Quiz Game

A console-based quiz game built using C++.

## ✨ Features

* Multiple quiz categories
* Multiple-choice questions
* Score calculation
* Player name input
* High-score tracking
* Different difficulty levels
* Interactive console interface

## 🛠️ Concepts Used

* C++
* Functions
* Arrays
* Strings
* `vector`
* `pair`
* `set`
* Loops and conditionals
* STL
* Sorting
* Basic object-oriented programming

## 📌 Project Goalone the repository:

This project was created to practice C++ programming and STL concepts while building something interactive rather than only solving individual programming exercises.

